ro Haruto is so nice,)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(but if Uncle and Auntie tell him to)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(there is absolutely no way he could ever@turn her down.)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":400,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(I have to do something here...)"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}
